WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.583
Another year without the postseason…

00:00:01.583 --> 00:00:03.125
Dear God, or the Dalai Lama or whatever,

00:00:03.125 --> 00:00:04.208
I don’t know, I’m still searching-

00:00:04.583 --> 00:00:05.666
Please show me the way.

00:00:05.666 --> 00:00:06.583
JORDY NELSON?!

00:00:06.583 --> 00:00:08.083
Now I hope you weren’t trying to tank.

00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:09.083
Tanking’s a sin.

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:09.708
No, but sometimes I wish

00:00:09.708 --> 00:00:11.125
I was just never even drafted at all.

00:00:11.541 --> 00:00:12.250
That’s an idea.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:13.666
What do you think, Vince Lombardi?

00:00:13.666 --> 00:00:14.750
OK. I agree.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.041
You’ve never been drafted.

00:00:16.041 --> 00:00:17.041
Hey, my leg stopped hurting-

00:00:17.041 --> 00:00:17.666
What.

00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:18.958
I’m 49 years old

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:20.833
and I’m still the quarterback of the Packers.

00:00:23.791 --> 00:00:25.750
Without you, Brett Favre wouldn’t leave.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.875
The Packers haven’t won a game in 10 years.

00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:29.166
State Farm shut down.

00:00:29.166 --> 00:00:30.916
Nobody was here to discount double check.

00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:34.000
The Bears won that 2010 NFC championship.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:36.416
I’m Jay Cutler, and I never give up.

00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:38.041
Clay! Clay, don’t you know me?

00:00:38.041 --> 00:00:40.083
HELP! THIS MAN IS SCARING ME!

00:00:40.083 --> 00:00:41.250
JORDY! GET ME BACK.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.166
I want to be on the Packers again!

00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:44.541
Hey Aaron-

00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:45.541
Hey, watch your-

00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:47.083
MY LEG’S HURTING, BRETT!

00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:48.125
MY LEG’S HURTING!

00:00:48.125 --> 00:00:50.000
MERRY CHRISTMAS GREEN BAY!

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:50.583
Aaron!

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.416
The owner’s going to make changes!

00:00:52.416 --> 00:00:53.750
We are going to hire someone

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:55.708
with imaginative play-calling!

00:00:55.958 --> 00:00:57.416
Every time a whistle blows

00:00:57.416 --> 00:00:58.416
the Packers still have

00:00:58.416 --> 00:01:00.000
more rings than the Bears.

